Package: the-cockpit
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Laden AS <post@laden.no>
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Recommends: wezterm, fish, python3, openssh-client, less
Homepage: https://laden.no/portefolje/the-cockpit/
Description: emerald terminal cockpit built on WezTerm
 The CockPit turns WezTerm into a green, frameless terminal cockpit with a
 right-click menu for tabs, splits and layouts, fish as the default shell,
 Python learning helpers, optional AI command-line tool discovery, explicit
 SSH connections and a read-only hardware overview.
 .
 WezTerm itself is not in the Debian archive: install it from
 https://wezterm.org/install/linux.html (signed APT repository) or use the
 CockPit tarball/AppImage, which bundle it.
 .
